  "totalBlocks": 60,
  "translatedBlocks": 58,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6f75c5d83d45e61",
      "translationZh": "Modular Diffusers 引入了一种构建扩散流水线的新方式：组合可复用的模块。你无需从头编写整条流水线，而是可以自由搭配模块，创建符合自身需求的工作流！它为现有的 DiffusionPipeline 类提供了一种更灵活、可组合的替代方案，作为补充。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f893a0ad9f9c02ce",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们将逐步介绍 Modular Diffusers 的工作原理——从使用熟悉的 API 运行模块化流水线，到构建完全自定义的模块，并将它们组合成你自己的工作流。我们还将展示它如何与 Mellon 集成。Mellon 是一个基于节点的可视化工作流界面，你可以用它将 Modular Diffusers 的模块连接起来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e331da0741fb6d05",
      "translationZh": "目录",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d3b2aefa7524f88c",
      "translationZh": "快速入门",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5c46a900d74549fe",
      "translationZh": "自定义模块",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e8a7f26a27155333",
      "translationZh": "模块化仓库",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "551d6c797c0baf82",
      "translationZh": "社区流水线",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "84831ef3773023ff",
      "translationZh": "与 Mellon 集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d3b2aefa7524f88c",
      "translationZh": "快速入门",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2488dbf9db57c662",
      "translationZh": "下面是一个使用预构建模块运行 FLUX.2 Klein 4B 推理的简单示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be30bc849dd71630",
      "translationZh": "你会得到与使用标准 DiffusionPipeline 相同的结果，但这条流水线的底层实现却大不相同：它由灵活的模块组成，包括文本编码、图像编码、去噪和解码，你可以直接查看这些模块：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a6099448d1062b4",
      "translationZh": "每个模块都是独立完备的，拥有自己的输入和输出。你可以将任意模块作为一条独立的流水线运行，也可以自由添加、移除和替换模块——它们会动态重新组合，与剩余的任何模块协同工作。使用 .init_pipeline() 将模块转换为可运行的流水线，并使用 .load_components() 加载模型权重。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d24cd64c35c6ac6d",
      "translationZh": "有关模块类型、组合模式、延迟加载以及使用 ComponentsManager 进行内存管理的更多信息，请参阅 Modular Diffusers 文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5c46a900d74549fe",
      "translationZh": "自定义模块",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b6fdb297ad75585",
      "translationZh": "创建自己的模块时，Modular Diffusers 的优势才真正显现出来。自定义模块是一个 Python 类，用于定义其组件、输入、输出和计算逻辑——定义完成后，你就可以将其接入任何工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e8f0ff636e8ac8b4",
      "translationZh": "编写自定义模块",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8984b1f0315a264",
      "translationZh": "下面是一个使用 Depth Anything V2 从图像中提取深度图的模块示例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b352c13acd1a6e81",
      "translationZh": "expected_components 定义模块需要哪些模型——在本例中是一个深度估计模型。pretrained_model_name_or_path 参数设置默认从哪个 Hub 仓库加载，因此，除非你在 modular_model_index.json 中覆盖此设置，否则 load_components 会自动获取该深度模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9b3d394f466092a2",
      "translationZh": "inputs 和 intermediate_outputs 定义输入和输出的内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a470ded81faaf44d",
      "translationZh": "__call__ 是计算逻辑所在的位置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "dab864f95965234e",
      "translationZh": "将模块组合成工作流",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1174784381bc211e",
      "translationZh": "让我们将这个模块用于 Qwen 的 ControlNet 工作流。提取 ControlNet 工作流，并在开头插入深度模块：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbeeb0daf65c2698",
      "translationZh": "序列中的模块会自动共享数据：深度模块的 control_image 输出会流向需要它的下游模块，而它的 image 输入则会成为流水线输入，因为没有更早的模块提供该输入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "97bf0f635e41df5e",
      "translationZh": "在 Hub 上共享自定义模块",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8b08a30e06e1e9b",
      "translationZh": "你可以将自定义模块发布到 Hub，这样任何人都可以通过设置 trust_remote_code=True 来加载它。我们创建了一个模板来帮助你入门——完整的操作流程请参阅《构建自定义模块》指南。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71d17c549e0b2d12",
      "translationZh": "本文中的 DepthProcessorBlock 已发布在 diffusers/depth-processor-custom-block，你可以直接加载并使用它：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "132cb42dd52f9bf1",
      "translationZh": "我们在这里发布了一组开箱即用的自定义模块。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e8a7f26a27155333",
      "translationZh": "模块化仓库",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e698a1c6394678a5",
      "translationZh": "ModularPipeline.from_pretrained 开箱即用，可用于任何现有的 Diffusers 仓库，但 Modular Diffusers 还引入了一种新型仓库：模块化仓库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3a74af4a13947d5",
      "translationZh": "模块化仓库能够引用组件原本所在的模型仓库中的组件。例如，diffusers/flux2-bnb-4bit-modular 包含一个量化的 transformer，并从原始仓库加载其余组件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd5b50140706eebb",
      "translationZh": "模块化仓库还可以托管以 Python 代码形式提供的自定义流水线模块，以及供 Mellon 等工具使用的可视化 UI 配置——所有内容都集中在一个地方。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "551d6c797c0baf82",
      "translationZh": "社区流水线",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4737bf3fcf4fa3f8",
      "translationZh": "社区已经开始使用 Modular Diffusers 构建完整的流水线，并将其发布到 Hub 上，同时提供模型权重和可直接运行的代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f470dba592d5d198",
      "translationZh": "Krea Realtime Video — 一个从 Wan 2.1 蒸馏而来的 14B 参数实时视频生成模型，在单张 B200 GPU 上可达到 11fps。它支持文本生成视频、视频生成视频以及流式视频生成视频——这些功能全部以模块化构建块实现。用户可以在生成过程中修改提示词、即时改变视频风格，并在 1 秒内看到首批画面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1d6a5f99c9541b37",
      "translationZh": "Waypoint-1 — Overworld 推出的一个 2.3B 参数实时扩散世界模型。它根据控制输入和文本提示词，以自回归方式生成可交互的世界——你可以在消费级硬件上实时探索生成的环境并与之交互。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "162dc75bd0bb0878",
      "translationZh": "团队可以构建全新的架构，将其封装为构建块，并把整条流水线发布到 Hub 上，让任何人都能通过 ModularPipeline.from_pretrained 使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "012c1d496c3f3ddb",
      "translationZh": "查看完整的社区流水线合集，了解更多内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "84831ef3773023ff",
      "translationZh": "与 Mellon 集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a861655b412992b5",
      "translationZh": "💡 Mellon 尚处于开发早期，还不能用于生产环境。你可以通过这里的内容，抢先了解这项集成的工作方式！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e8498f5d1ebd55b",
      "translationZh": "Mellon 是一个与 Modular Diffusers 集成的节点图界面。如果你熟悉 ComfyUI 这类基于节点的工具，就会感到十分亲切——不过，两者之间有一些关键区别：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "848cc87575556a45",
      "translationZh": "动态节点——我们只提供少量节点，而不是数十种针对特定模型的节点；这些节点会根据你选择的模型自动调整界面。学会一次，就能用于任何模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8d882d132c19e9c3",
      "translationZh": "单节点工作流——借助 Modular Diffusers 的可组合模块系统，你可以将整条流水线合并为一个节点。在同一画布上运行多个工作流，也不会显得杂乱。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e89e6f758b223f2c",
      "translationZh": "开箱即用的 Hub 集成——发布到 Hugging Face Hub 的自定义模块可以立即在 Mellon 中使用。我们提供了一个工具函数，可根据你的模块定义自动生成节点界面，无需编写 UI 代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1fd607a3e78b0bb6",
      "translationZh": "这种集成之所以能够实现，是因为每个模块都暴露相同的属性（inputs、intermediate_outputs、expected_components）。这种一致的 API 意味着 Mellon 可以根据任何模块定义自动生成节点的 UI，并将模块组合成更高层级的节点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8565672a3f904125",
      "translationZh": "例如，diffusers/FLUX.2-klein-4B-modular 在同一个仓库中包含了流水线定义、组件引用以及一个 mellon_pipeline_config.json。在 Python 中使用 ModularPipeline.from_pretrained(\"diffusers/FLUX.2-klein-4B-modular\") 加载它，或在 Mellon 中加载它，即可创建单节点或多节点工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d04179585b01877",
      "translationZh": "下面是一个简单示例。我们向现有的文生图工作流中添加一个 Gemini 提示词扩展节点，该节点以模块化仓库的形式托管在 diffusers/gemini-prompt-expander-mellon：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "059bab994e915ffb",
      "translationZh": "拖入一个 Dynamic Block 节点，并输入 repo_id（即 diffusers/gemini-prompt-expander-mellon）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5a57f1461063465d",
      "translationZh": "点击 LOAD CUSTOM BLOCK——节点会自动新增一个供你输入提示词的文本框，以及一个名为 \"prompt\" 的输出端口，所有配置均来自该仓库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "220fdb962c1934c7",
      "translationZh": "输入一段简短的提示词，将输出连接到 Encode Prompt 节点，然后运行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c252e32e15e6324",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 会先将你的简短提示词扩展为详细描述，再生成图像。无需代码，无需配置——只需一个 Hub 仓库 id。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "529c6f1b9405d4c7",
      "translationZh": "这只是一个示例。如需详细的操作指南，请查看 Mellon x Modular Diffusers 指南。你也可以看看这个视频！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结语",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5825864118e971ec",
      "translationZh": "Modular Diffusers 带来了社区一直期待的可组合性和灵活性，同时保留了让 Diffusers 如此强大的各项功能。目前仍处于早期阶段——我们希望通过你的反馈来塑造接下来的发展方向。试用一下，告诉我们哪些地方好用、哪些地方不好用，以及还缺少什么。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e89b30aa1dc30a6a",
      "translationZh": "资源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
